      "nodeType": "lemma",
      "title": "Necessary row-and-column occupancy at sizes 153 and 154",
      "summary": "Every no-three-in-line subset of G_77 has at most two points per row and per column. A valid 154-point set must therefore have exactly two points in every row and column. A valid 153-point set must have two points in 76 rows and one in the remaining row, and the analogous column pattern. These conditions are necessary only.",
