      "parentId": "program/record-certificate-and-perturbation",
      "nodeType": "result",
      "title": "Saturation and removal rigidity of the eight specified embeddings",
      "summary": "For each specified embedding E, all 5,777 outside cells are blocked, so E is inclusion-maximal. Removing one embedded point frees no originally outside cell. Removing any pair frees at most one originally outside cell; exactly 16 removal pairs per embedding free an outside cell, distributed as four pairs for each of four cells. The result is an exhaustive local account through removal depth two, not a maximum-cardinality claim.",
